{"signature": "8156c6280b6556f3de162587e3b7074af250d9f435e736c51af373bc5aebe38d", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "linear", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/issues", "field": "identifier", "values": ["ART-555", "ART-566", "ART-606", "ART-749", "ART-778", "ART-792", "ENG-1508", "ENG-1605", "ENG-2078", "ZOM-114", "ZOM-121", "ZOM-172", "ZOM-206", "ZOM-224", "ZOM-302"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/363", "field": "identifier", "value": "ART-555", "record": {"id": "ART-555", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ART", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ART-555", "number": 555, "title": "Streak Announcer Text", "description": "Each time you win a streak you get a congratulation message popup that appears and disappears without interrupting the game.\n\n![StreakBonusAnnouncens.gif]([URL_50217])\n\n![StreakBonusAnnouncens2.gif]([URL_50216])\n\nAwesome!\nDivine!\nExcellent!\nWell Done!\nIncredible!\n\nPerfect!\n\nWow!\n\nand\n\nX-rated audio pack \ud83d\ude09 \nGood girl\nDaddy's so proud\nYou deserve better\n\nor:\n\n 1. \u201cSplendid move!\u201d\n 2. \u201cMarvelous!\u201d\n 3. \u201cOutstanding!\u201d\n 4. \u201cEnchanting play!\u201d\n 5. \u201cBravo, noble player!\u201d\n 6. \u201cMagnificent!\u201d\n 7. \u201cLegendary!\u201d\n 8. \u201cA masterstroke!\u201d\n 9. \u201cVictorious move!\u201d\n10. \u201cEnchanting!\u201d\n11. \u201cA move worthy of a knight!\u201d\n12. \u201cExquisite!\u201d\n13. \u201cA glorious play!\u201d\n14. \u201cTriumphant!\u201d\n15. \u201cMajestic!\u201d\n16. \u201cA regal play!\u201d\n17. \u201cSuperb!\u201d\n18. \u201cA heroic feat!\u201d\n19. \u201cAstounding!\u201d\n20. \u201cNoble effort!\u201d\n\nor\n\n 1. \u201cSplendid!\u201d\n 2. \u201cMarvelous!\u201d\n 3. \u201cOutstanding!\u201d\n 4. \u201cEnchanting!\u201d\n 5. \u201cBravo!\u201d\n 6. \u201cMagnificent!\u201d\n 7. \u201cLegendary!\u201d\n 8. \u201cMasterful!\u201d\n 9. \u201cVictorious!\u201d\n10. \u201cExquisite!\u201d\n11. \u201cGlorious!\u201d\n12. \u201cTriumphant!\u201d\n13. \u201cMajestic!\u201d\n14. \u201cRegal!\u201d\n15. \u201cSuperb!\u201d\n16. \u201cHeroic!\u201d\n17. \u201cAstounding!\u201d\n18. \u201cNoble!\u201d\n19. \u201cGrand!\u201d\n20. \u201cEpic!\u201d\n\n---\n\nFINAL TEXT HERE:\n\n 1. Brilliant!\n 2. Fantastic!\n 3. Phenomenal!\n 4. Impressive!\n 5. Awesome!\n 6. Incredible!\n 7. Spectacular!\n 8. Extraordinary!\n 9. Remarkable!\n10. Well Done!\n\nAll the characters will do thumbs up animation during the text display animation", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-26T11:04:04Z", "completed_at": "2024-05-17T19:38:31Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 913121, "labels": ["Streak System", "VFX Integration", "Improvement", "VFX&SOUNDS", "GAMEPLAY"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ENG-857", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-23T15:50:06Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-20T16:53:41Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/374", "field": "identifier", "value": "ART-566", "record": {"id": "ART-566", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ART", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_7fe31e7ec8199618", "creator_id": "usr_Victor Barnes", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ART-566", "number": 566, "title": "Coin packs (Shop)", "description": "Create 3 packs for the shop: Small, Middle, Big\n\n[[URL_50273])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-29T16:40:03Z", "completed_at": "2024-05-13T16:08:02Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-11-14T07:20:38Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 923246, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-29T16:40:03Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-13T16:08:02Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/412", "field": "identifier", "value": "ART-606", "record": {"id": "ART-606", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ART", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ART-606", "number": 606, "title": "List of new skill icons and other icon needs", "description": "These are for streak bonuses, character UI, etc.\n\nSkills are:\n\n- [X] Nate's and Julius' remove X number of face up cards (Tile removal)\n- [X] Lexi's foresight we currently have the crystal ball, are we happy with that? (Tile reveal)\n- [X] Julius replace random faceup tiles with Gold Tile (Tile replace)\n- [X] Lexi's reveal next tile in draw pile (Draw pile reveal)\n- [X] Nate's passive ability that allows player to start the game with (+1 tile in draw pile and starting hand tile is a jumbo tile) **???**\n- [X] Nate's passive ability that allows player to start the game with (+1 tile in draw pile and a gold tile in starting hand)\n- [X] Fire icon for a fire token to be used in tile dozer game. When this token is collected, it lights the fuse for the bomb tile. This is a simple circular tile we already have in the prototype, shaped like a coin, but on it is a fire icon.\n- [X] Our 4th in-game boost, \"Magical Wind\". It's a gust of wind that will blow away all face up tiles and remove them from the board.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-06-07T12:55:59Z", "completed_at": "2024-07-11T08:29:09Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 838745, "labels": ["2D ART", "Sprint 20 - July 5th", "Spells/Abilities"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-06-05T21:41:47Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-11T08:29:09Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/556", "field": "identifier", "value": "ART-749", "record": {"id": "ART-749", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ART", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ART-749", "number": 749, "title": "Marketing Video With Aditional Character", "description": "This is just a marketing video that we can create in combination with unity and after effects to produce something that can grab attention and then focuse a bit on a simple idea of our gameplay\n\n![image.png]([URL_51675])\n\n@julia.lawson will help us with the level itself so we can play it (we are thinking to have less tiles and something more simple to play with and perhaps the tiles be zoomed in so they are bigger)\n\n@[PERSON_NAME_0116] will provide AI generated characters/creatures and brake them into body parts so we can animate them with unity 2d animation bones just like a \"Spline\" animation\n\n@[PERSON_NAME_0054] will provide support for aditional flow of the animation and story as well for the text that will be displayed above, \"feed the squirrel! Match the tiles!\" etc!", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-11-26T10:49:06Z", "completed_at": "2025-01-09T10:11:21Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 576563, "labels": ["Sprint 27 Nova - Dec 6th", "Marketing", "VFX&SOUNDS"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-26T10:49:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-09T10:11:21Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/586", "field": "identifier", "value": "ART-778", "record": {"id": "ART-778", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ART", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ART-778", "number": 778, "title": "Unlocked in-Game boosters screens", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-04-15T13:22:43Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-10-16T02:49:33Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 438132, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-04-15T13:22:43Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-15T13:23:29Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/591", "field": "identifier", "value": "ART-792", "record": {"id": "ART-792", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ART", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_175c0d7bc72ed244", "state_id": "Team Epic", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ART-792", "number": 792, "title": "ZM3D - Marketing Screenshots round 3", "description": "Can you use your eye for composition to mock up a new set of potential screenshots to A/B test against our current set? Feel free to completely re-envision the theme. That is, don't feel like you need to follow any of the current design choices \u2014 such as limited the matching items to a single color, keeping the matching area the same size as it currently is, or even displaying the matching area at all.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 246277, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-08-26T18:57:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-26T18:57:06Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1375", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-1508", "record": {"id": "ENG-1508", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1508", "number": 1508, "title": "Hero Growth Pack Offers - 3D character animations to make them look good", "description": "Once @[PERSON_NAME_0120] brings in the 3D characters in the offers, we need a final touch from @Marcus to make offers looks really good with sparkles/basic animations around the character.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-09-26T09:24:17Z", "completed_at": "2024-09-29T11:29:47Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-03-30T07:35:40Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 723364, "labels": ["Characters", "Desire Release"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-09-23T17:48:11Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-29T11:29:47Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1481", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-1605", "record": {"id": "ENG-1605", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1605", "number": 1605, "title": "Additional VFX needed for hero growth pack tiers", "description": "You know what this is Marcus - just do it when you have time", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-10-04T17:47:35Z", "completed_at": "2024-10-10T08:54:43Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-04-15T07:35:20Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 707680, "labels": ["Destiny"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-10-01T17:57:35Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-14T19:55:13Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1994", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2078", "record": {"id": "ENG-2078", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2064", "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2078", "number": 2078, "title": "Create Generic VFXs for the event icon system", "description": "As discussed in the meeting, we need some generic animations we can use at the spur of the moment while developing the prototypes. We are missing the following to get this ticket going: \n\n1. Marcus will look into other games and what the current trends are \n2. Marcus will show us the options \n\nAfter that, we can build a few simple animations to use for any icon. The effects we considered are the document for the Event Icon System document, and they are size change, tilt, bounce, and sparkle. But those are just starting ideas and the list can be finalized after Marcus tackles the first two issues.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-20T14:13:22Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-05T09:34:18Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-11-06T04:09:46Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 409560, "labels": ["Avengers", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-20T12:30:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T09:34:18Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3211", "field": "identifier", "value": "ZOM-114", "record": {"id": "ZOM-114", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-114", "number": 114, "title": "Card pack ripping animation", "description": "The card pack rigging animation will be done using a bone system. This way, we can animate all the the card as long as their shape doesn't shape. \n\nOverall vibe: The players will see this animation A LOT. So the animation should be fast enough, but still appealing.\n\nThe generic flow: \n\n1. The pack comes onto the screen from small to big. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52488])\n\n2.  for \"Tap to Open\" action to take place. (we're not doing the hand)\n\n   ![image.png]([URL_52487])\n\n\n3. The pack rips open. As the sides come apart the card is revealed. When the ripped card parts are out of the screen, the card becomes bigger. From there 3 scenerios can happen:\n\na. Displays a \"new\" tag if the player doesn't own the item and let players to clam.\nb. Don't display the new tag if the player already owns. Players can claim.   \n\n![image.png]([URL_52486])\n\nc. The cards can turn into bones. \n\n(Marcus will fill the details. But basically, the card will spin into a vertex and come back out with a satisfying counter animation until the bones come out. Meanwhile, the text for the card will go down in the counter, and after it hits 0, go back up as the image becomes bones)\n\n![image.png]([URL_52485])\n\n \n\nSFX: Ripping sound, swoosh.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-13T22:25:11Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-09T16:13:30Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 358761, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-06T15:43:59Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-09T16:13:30Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3219", "field": "identifier", "value": "ZOM-121", "record": {"id": "ZOM-121", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-118", "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-121", "number": 121, "title": "Card pack animation in the shop", "description": "![image.png]([URL_52516])\n\nIn the rotating shop, we have a bigger container for the \"gem for cards\" section. This card needs to animate to make it more enticing for the players to buy. Since you said animating the guy on the card isn't feasible, then the card itself needs to do something. We agreed to try a \"swoosh swoosh\" type animation for the card, something that will highlight it's plasticly/aluminum feel. This animation should loop once per shop animation and shouldn't loop. Ideally it's 2-2,5 seconds long. \n\nBasically, the idea is to apply distorting force to several points in the object and make it swish. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52515])\n\n![image.png]([URL_52514])\n\nHere is a sequence example I made with AI. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52513])\n\nIf this is not what you had in mind when we talked about it, or it proves to be too time consuming, please reach out so we can create another solution.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353467, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-12T07:55:19Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T08:27:18Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3275", "field": "identifier", "value": "ZOM-172", "record": {"id": "ZOM-172", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-166", "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-172", "number": 172, "title": "Need the quickest VFX we can implement to open a card pack with 10 cards inside.", "description": "'@Marcus change of plans. Each card pack will have 10 cards.\n\nWe will NOT allow players to open multiple packs at once, but instead just one pack containing 10 cards.\n\nThis shouldn't be too different from what we originally have planned (allowing players to open 10 packs of 1 card each at once)\n\nPlease let [PERSON_NAME_0120] know where this VFX is at so he can quickly implement. Let's get something functional quickly, and polish after.", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-29T12:46:19Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-09T16:13:14Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 358761, "labels": ["VFX"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-28T23:40:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-09T16:13:14Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3312", "field": "identifier", "value": "ZOM-206", "record": {"id": "ZOM-206", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-206", "number": 206, "title": "Use the pack colors as guideline for card rarity color", "description": "'@[PERSON_NAME_0054] said:\n\n> Hmm in FIGMA they almost look the same too. Can we use the colors from the packs [PERSON_NAME_0120] to designate rarity color? See reference:\n\n![image.png]([URL_52555])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-06-23T17:54:42Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 338500, "labels": ["Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-06-03T08:10:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-23T17:54:42Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3332", "field": "identifier", "value": "ZOM-224", "record": {"id": "ZOM-224", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_c77c50cc15c5342d", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-224", "number": 224, "title": "Change pack open action to 'click anywhere'", "description": "'@[PERSON_NAME_0054] said:\n\n> @Marcus Pack open needs to be \"click anywhere\" to open and not just click on the pack.", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-06-09T08:51:52Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 359202, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-06-05T23:14:20Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-09T08:51:52Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3418", "field": "identifier", "value": "ZOM-302", "record": {"id": "ZOM-302", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-301", "assignee_id": "usr_51f5f16d46e8cf55", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-302", "number": 302, "title": "Martin to repurpose UI from DD for ZM for helpshift's 1 screen", "description": null, "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-07-08T14:16:46Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 317118, "labels": ["UI", "30 June"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-06-23T20:03:08Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-08T14:16:46Z"}}], "records_checked": 3852, "files_selected": 1, "files_completed": 1, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 1, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "manifest_sha256": "b299d01377efd99db02ba7f6bb072a6d539b00d970b492b9e79b68353d3f5310", "freshness": "0c8cb14eff44696bf96f29fd29e43b66c16bb8f3b05dd3444d4fdf354ff98c37"}], "scan_complete": true, "persona_filtered": false, "backend": "grouped-record-scan", "scope_note": "Exact direct fields in selected arrays. No SQL is applied. Absence/uniqueness is supported only within complete declared scopes. Manifest hashes are declared provenance, not fresh full-content hashes."}, "checksum": "79e9c08113b3eafa42c905b5db0a03e2960610da601474be74535ecd34a4d9f4"}